\fs36 \cf0 Referential Integrity Test\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 I attempted to delete the Library and Information Science department while a student was still assigned to it.\
MySQL returned Error 1451 because the department was referenced by a student record through a foreign key.\
This demonstrates referential integrity: MySQL prevents the deletion of a parent record while dependent child records still reference it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 How I Fixed It\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 I reassigned the student to the Software Engineering department before deleting Library and Information Science.\
The department was then deleted successfully. }